Hello, I would like to work out how to split a bill at my café.

First, please ask me what the bill amount is.
Then please ask me how many people are sharing the bill.
Then please ask me how the service was. The answer will be good, okay or bad.

If the service was good, the tip should be 20% of the bill. If it was okay, the tip should be 15%, and if it was bad, the tip should be 10%.

Please show me the tip, then the total including the tip, and then how much each person needs to pay. Please show all of these in dollars and cents, for example $12.34.

Thank you very much!
